flowchart TB
  checkout[Developer checkout] --> shell[Terminal: Bash, Fish, Zsh, or Windows cmd]
  shell --> go[Go 1.24.5 toolchain]
  shell --> scripts[Shell, cmd, and PowerShell entry points]
  scripts --> local[Local workstation]
  go --> binaries[Compiled .build/bin tools]
  binaries --> local
  local --> userConfig[User and application config directories]
  local --> scheduler[Windows Task Scheduler or macOS launch agents]
  local --> packageTools[Installed package managers and applications]
  local --> network[HTTPS-capable network]
  network --> external[GitHub, models.dev, and OpenRouter endpoints]
